Package: pointcoral
Title: Local CPCe Point-Count Processing for Coral Photoquadrats
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Elvin", "Cordero", email = "elvin.cordero@seamountgeo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Imports CPCe point-count annotations and related exported
    tables, standardizes labels with a user-supplied crosswalk, creates
    ecological cover summaries, writes quality-control overlays, and exports
    machine-learning-ready point labels, image patches, sparse masks, and
    train/validation/test splits. The package is fully local and does not
    depend on MERMAID, mermaidr, CoralNet accounts, or other closed platforms.
